{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"rejectionReports","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV16rejectionReportsScSyAA15RejectionReportVGvp","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L214","fileName":"Tracker.swift"},"roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"rejectionReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","text":"AsyncStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","text":"RejectionReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"constraintViolation()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before anything else, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"break them. Copies of a tracker share one sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker has finished. A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" tracker’s is empty.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/RejectionReport":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RejectionReport"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"RejectionReport","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Events a tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared on it: the event’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text"